# UX workflow: ADR-0015/0016 closeout track-return persistence smoke.
# Purpose: validates that child content remains visible after leaving the child
# context, changing track, and returning to the original track. This guards the
# regression where nested contexts disappeared after track navigation.

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen sequencer_ready

# Enable Track 1 step 1, open its step editor, and create a micro-sequence.
150 tap MACRO_1 60
320 capture screen t01_step_enabled
420 button MACRO_1 down
1480 tick
1540 capture screen t01_step_edit_open
1600 button MACRO_1 up
1700 encoder NAV 1
1780 encoder NAV 1
1860 encoder NAV 1
1940 encoder NAV 1
2020 encoder NAV 1
2100 encoder NAV 1
2260 capture screen t01_micro_row_focused
2360 tap NAV 60
2660 capture screen t01_micro_context_open

# Edit micro step 1 so the child content is visibly non-empty.
2760 button MACRO_1 down
3820 tick
3880 capture screen t01_micro_step_edit_open
3940 button MACRO_1 up
4040 encoder NAV 1
4140 encoder OPT 0.72
4360 capture screen t01_micro_step_note_offset
4460 tap NAV 60
4700 capture screen t01_micro_context_edited

# Return to the root grid.
4800 tap LEFT_TOP 60
5140 capture screen t01_parent_after_micro
5240 tap LEFT_TOP 60
5580 capture screen t01_root_badge_before_track_switch

# Switch navigation focus from page to track, create/select Track 2, then come
# back to Track 1.
5680 tap NAV 60
5880 capture screen track_navigation_focus
5980 encoder NAV 1
6180 capture screen t02_add_preview
6280 tap NAV 60
6580 capture screen t02_created
6680 encoder NAV -1
6980 capture screen t01_returned_after_track_switch

# Re-open Track 1 step 1. The micro-sequence row must still be present and
# openable; the user should not have to recreate child content.
7080 button MACRO_1 down
8140 tick
8200 capture screen t01_step_edit_after_return
8260 button MACRO_1 up
8360 encoder NAV 1
8440 encoder NAV 1
8520 encoder NAV 1
8600 encoder NAV 1
8680 encoder NAV 1
8760 encoder NAV 1
8920 capture screen t01_micro_row_still_present
9020 tap NAV 60
9320 capture screen t01_micro_context_reopened_after_return
